### 1. Exportar um mês
POST {{host}}/reports/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publication_month": 9,
  "publication_year": 2026
}

### 2. Exportar o ano inteiro
POST {{host}}/reports/export
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "publication_year": 2026
}

### 3. Acompanhar o runner (document_url chega quando finished = true)
GET {{host}}/reports/export/runner/{{runner_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
